          "description": "Get one listing: address, area, price, bedrooms, bathrooms, sqft, lot, type, year built, HOA, status, list date and days on market, price per sqft, the area median price, features, description, listing agent, price history, the next open showing slots and whether it is the lead's own listing. NOT_FOUND = no such listing. Facts only - the listings never describe schools, safety or who lives nearby.",
