    {
      "id": "flow:search_listings_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "search_listings_flow",
        "description": "Search Brightpath&#39;s Active and Pending listings in the Larkspur Valley metro. Every filter is applied by the system: area (Cedar Hollow, Willow Bend, Larkspur Downtown, Northgate, or empty for all), min_price and max_price in dollars, min_bedrooms, property_type (single family, townhouse, condo) and keywords (every word must appear in the listing; leave keywords empty for fuzzy wishes like &#39;walkable&#39; - send those to listing_match_agent with the rows instead). Returns up to 12 rows: listing_id, address, area, price, bedrooms, bathrooms, sqft, property_type, year_built, HOA, listing_status (Active or Pending), days on market, features and description. Status NO_MATCH = nothing found; loosen a filter. Use empty strings for filters the person did not give.",
